                <pb facs="0846" n="724" xml:id="pg724"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blaine to Mr.
                            Straus.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-06-19"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 19,
                        1889</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Express grateful appreciation President and Government United States for Sultan’s
                    generous relief flood sufferers.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Blaine.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
